+    "specs/inventory-snapshots/spec.md": """# Spec Delta
+
+## Purpose
+
+`inventory-snapshots` 为跨仓库存导出提供稳定的快照生命周期契约，使 Web 侧能够在快照 ready 后读取一致的数据内容。
+
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Register inventory snapshots
+The system SHALL accept a non-empty list of inventory items and return a stable snapshot identifier that can be used for readiness checks and content reads.
+
+#### Scenario: Register a valid snapshot
+- **WHEN** the caller registers a non-empty list of inventory items
+- **THEN** the system returns a unique snapshot identifier and the snapshot is not ready
+
+#### Scenario: Reject an empty snapshot
+- **WHEN** the caller registers an empty list of inventory items
+- **THEN** the system rejects the request with an explicit validation error
+
+### Requirement: Track snapshot readiness
+The system SHALL expose whether a registered snapshot is ready and SHALL allow an existing snapshot to transition from not ready to ready exactly once.
+
+#### Scenario: Transition registered snapshot to ready
+- **WHEN** the caller marks a registered snapshot as ready
+- **THEN** subsequent readiness checks return true
+
+#### Scenario: Reject readiness for unknown snapshot
+- **WHEN** the caller checks or marks an unknown snapshot
+- **THEN** the system raises an explicit not-found error
+
+### Requirement: Read ready snapshot contents
+The system SHALL return the registered inventory items for a snapshot only after that snapshot is ready.
+
+#### Scenario: Read a ready snapshot
+- **WHEN** the caller reads a ready snapshot
+- **THEN** the system returns the same ordered inventory items originally registered
+
+#### Scenario: Reject reading a not-ready snapshot
+- **WHEN** the caller reads a registered snapshot before it is ready
+- **THEN** the system raises an explicit not-ready error
+""",
